# Normalise to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout platform.
#
# Developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which had git warning "LF will
# be replaced by CRLF" on every text file in every diff — noise that hides real
# warnings. Nothing here depends on which ending reaches the working copy: the
# HTML normaliser in fields.py folds whitespace itself, and AnkiConnect is
# talked to over JSON, which carries its own escaping.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Resolved by uv, not written by hand. Diffing it is noise.
uv.lock -diff linguist-generated
